sequenceDiagram
    participant OSCollectors
    participant Detection
    participant SessionController
    participant LocalAudit
    participant ParticipantApp
    participant Backend
    OSCollectors->>Detection: Process instance and available identity evidence
    Detection->>SessionController: Supported execution finding with rule version
    SessionController->>SessionController: Apply event policy and invalidate local verification
    SessionController->>LocalAudit: Commit finding, decision, revision and outbox
    LocalAudit-->>SessionController: Durable commit acknowledged
    SessionController-->>ParticipantApp: Suspended with reason and review route
    LocalAudit->>Backend: Send idempotent event batch
    Backend->>Backend: Persist evidence and authoritative suspension
    Backend-->>LocalAudit: Accepted event IDs and session revision
    ParticipantApp->>Backend: Request organizer review
    Backend-->>ParticipantApp: Authorized decision and explanation
    Backend-->>SessionController: Reinstatement authorization requires fresh preflight
